From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:07:44 +0000
Subject: feat(compose): add preemptible context idle lane
 (withKuiklyIdleContext)

Adds withKuiklyIdleContext(pagerId) for speculative work that must yield to
normal context work. Common admission logic runs one idle callback at a time
after the pager's normal work drains and re-admits when new work arrives.
Android and OHOS back it with native idle admission at background priority.
iOS is a stub for now: idle admissions are posted as normal tasks on the
#1566 dedicated context thread (same API, not preemptible natively).

Fork-Patch: compose-context-idle-lane
Origin: a80c06de
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

